torchvision notice
==================

This project uses torchvision (https://github.com/pytorch/vision) for datasets
and model definitions. torchvision is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause license;
see the upstream repository for the full text of that license.

No code from torchvision is vendored: it is imported at runtime. The CIFAR
dataset wrapper adds our own deterministic global split logic on top of the
standard torchvision dataset API.